<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>蒙台梭利Montessori</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #111, #2a2a2a);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            min-height: 100vh;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .bg-box {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            font-size: 18px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 40px 0;
        }
        h1 .bg-box {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .wavy-underline {
            text-decoration: underline wavy #ffe500;
            text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
            text-underline-offset: 6px;
        }
        .section {
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .line-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .line-group .bg-box {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1><span class="bg-box">蒙台梭利Montessori</span></h1>

        <div class="line-group">
            <span class="bg-box">蒙特梭利教学法并非一成不变，这种教学法是开放的，</span>
            <span class="bg-box">且建立在蒙特梭利教育哲学和精神之上。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="line-group">
            <span class="bg-box">非常强调环境对儿童的影响，</span>
            <span class="bg-box">主张理想的教室必须具备以下五种要素：</span>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <span class="bg-box wavy-underline">1、自由的观念</span>

            <span class="bg-box">●<span class="wavy-underline">儿童只有在自由、开放的环境下才能将学习发挥到极点</span></span>

            <span class="bg-box">●蒙特梭利并不赞同没有经过过滤的自由。</span>

            <div class="line-group">
                <span class="bg-box">●儿童可以依照自己的兴趣选择教具，</span>
                <span class="bg-box">也可以依照自己的喜好选择学习的地点及时间。</span>
            </div>

            <span class="bg-box">●<span class="wavy-underline">孩子之间可以相互观摩学习，是一种混龄式的教学。</span></span>

            <span class="bg-box">●<span class="wavy-underline">废除传统教学中惯用的奖惩制度</span></span>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <span class="bg-box">2、结构与秩序</span>

            <span class="bg-box">●<span class="wavy-underline">将教具按照其难度加以排列，较有秩序及结构感。</span></span>

            <span class="bg-box">●<span class="wavy-underline">养成儿童自动自发、物归原处的生活习惯。</span></span>

            <div class="line-group">
                <span class="bg-box">●外在环境的结构只是为配合儿童的学习，</span>
                <span class="bg-box">教师们应视儿童的需要而适时更换教室的陈设，</span>
                <span class="bg-box">在有序中保持弹性。</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
